# This is the project's tech stack

- Svelte, Typescript and tailwindCSS for building frontend components.
- Vanilla CSS, DOM manipulation methods where needed.
- prosemirror for rich text editor.
- Yjs with prosemirror for enabling live collaboration.

## Project directory structure

- root repository has packages directory.
- packages contains frontend code for password manager project and livnote project.
- common frontend compoents are placed in common directory.
- Only livnote project is currently being worked on which is a collaboration focused live rich text editor.






